1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,197
In sixteen eighty six, Newton had to decide how the gas is squeezed as sound passes.

2
00:00:06,197 --> 00:00:13,307
He argued that the squeezing is gentle, so any heat produced in a compression leaks away at once.

3
00:00:13,307 --> 00:00:15,247
The temperature stays constant.

4
00:00:15,247 --> 00:00:18,294
In other words, an isothermal change.

